{"reviewId": "217417001_840zONvWE", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "比如，原油以美元计价，在衰退预期下，若美联储开启降息和量化宽松（信用膨胀），美元贬值会直接推高以美元计价的原油名义价格。\n通货膨胀时期，投资者会大量购入原油等实物资产来对冲货币购买力的下降。这种金融需求会完全脱离实物供需，独自推高价格。\n投机资本：全球泛滥的流动性会涌入原油期货市场，放大价格的波动，使得价格在短期内严重偏离基本面。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "5450-5546", "abstract": "如果从现象上来看，衰退期的通货膨胀至少是一种必然现象，我们在前面也提出了长波衰退期资源约束与信用膨胀的基本逻辑。这种以能源为代表的原材料价格的上涨到底有没有内在的原因，也是我们必须探究的问题。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "217417001_840zONvWE", "userVid": 217417001, "topics": [], "createTime": 1760840118, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 217417001, "name": "众善", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/XgAfYGGIakmyjZ3kD7yUoT85G9dfpAGdZojqn5gWMt1xrRGFsPzzqGZ4O19zGLbXNv0xxDHbMxFOS0lHnatutGy9XqKJrkZXmJv3pMXYz1w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "众善", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 243960417, "name": "afk", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0007-ehuyS8GJvDbK0N63e0Gmd10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "离岸人名币汇率都6.84了", "reviewId": "